					<description><![CDATA[Today we are excited to ship the Initiators Music Kit Box, featuring music kits from 3kliksphilip, Humanity&#8217;s Last Breath, Juelz, Knock2, Meechy Darko, and Sullivan King. Whether you&#8217;re a fan of dance music, hip-hop, rock, or CS:GO content creators, there&#8217;s a music kit for everyone. The Initiators Music Kit Box is now available for purchase [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/apps/csgo/images/blog/initiators_final.png" data-rel="lightbox-image-0" data-magnific_type="image" data-rl_title="" data-rl_caption="" title=""><img decoding="async" src="https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/apps/csgo/images/blog/initiators_final.png" alt="" width="100%"/></a><br />
