<p>Whether you&#8217;re a fan of dance music, hip-hop, rock, or CS:GO content creators, there&#8217;s a music kit for everyone. The Initiators Music Kit Box is now available for purchase in-game!</p>
<p>As part of today&#8217;s update, 10 Year Birthday Coins are no longer possible to earn. Thank you to all the players who celebrated CS:GO&#8217;s 10th birthday with us and earned their coin!</p>
